<title>INDIA: India Hindalco 1996/97 net seen higher.</title>
<headline>India Hindalco 1996/97 net seen higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's biggest private aluminium maker Hindalco Industries Ltd's net profit is projected to rise 2.81 percent to 4.1 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll showed.</p>
<p>Analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms forecast a low of 3.65 billion rupees and a high of 4.23 billion rupees against 4.01 billion rupees a year ago.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>HINDALCO  ----PAT seen up 2.81%, sales down 3.82%</p>
<p>		     Net profit   1995/96    Net sales   1995/96</p>
<p>				(in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		4,124.32   4,011.46   12,040.17   12,518.06</p>
<p>High		   4,235.00		  15,831.40</p>
<p>Low		    3,650.00		  10,730.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
